    "offset_justification": "NHPN models the facility as a single centerline with no median geometry; the 20 m carriageway-centreline separation matches a typical rural divided interstate cross-section (two 12 ft lanes per carriageway around a 40 ft-class depressed median = 64 ft = 19.5 m; common medians span 36-60 ft). Authored uniform model parameter per ADR-0017 - never claimed as observed cross-section; per-site cross-sections are later lane-topology refinement.",
