    "offset_provenance": "authored",
    "pairing_rule": "Per directed element index k of segment s, the westbound edge '<s>:<k>:westbound' pairs the opposing edge '<s>:<k>:eastbound' in carriageway group '<s>:<k>' with roadway_kind divided_carriageway - a deterministic reciprocal rule over the locked element sequence rather than 12,582 explicit rows. The eastbound carriageway is the opposite offset of the same locked centerline with travel reversed, so the pair is reciprocal by construction and no opposing geometry is synthesized from unrelated nearby lines.",
