    "reversal_threshold_deg": 150.0,
    "side_rule": "The westbound carriageway offsets to the right of westbound travel; the source centerline is the median axis on the left of each directed carriageway, carrying ADR-0014 marking semantics (yellow continuous left/median edge, white broken same-direction dividers, white continuous right edge).",
